      "body": "Eligible shareholders must have bought the stock before 22 April 2026. Payment date: 29 May 2026. Payout ratio is a comfortable 32% and this is well supported by cash flows. Trailing yield: 1.4%. Lower than top quartile of Indian dividend payers (1.5%). Higher than average of industry peers (0.6%).",
